  27:../../libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****      *  During initialization, the state will be changed to either FACTORY,
  28:../../libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****      *  or USER. 
  29:../../libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****      * 
  30:../../libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****      *  If this is the first time these settings are being written to the
  31:../../libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****      *  target address, the defaults will be written to that location,
  32:../../libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****      *  and the state will be set to FACTORY.
  33:../../libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****      * 
  34:../../libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****      *  Once the first user-trigger save has been made, the state will be 
